          "text": "Upper back lump history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient noticed a little bump approximately 12–18/12 ago. It has gradually increased in size and now catches on hi vis and harness at work. Mild discomfort only when leaning on a hard chair or when the tool belt rubs; otherwise no pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
