        "code": {
          "text": "Upper back lesion examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mid upper back just left of midline at approximately T4–5: approximately 2.2 cm dome-shaped subcutaneous nodule, firm and mobile over deeper tissues, with normal overlying skin and a small central punctum. Non-tender to light palpation; mild discomfort with deep pressure."
      }
    },
